Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《大雄的猫狗时空传》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就可以见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球过去了大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又漏接了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄我们又不是在练习漏接
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要找到球才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦真烦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个要先回去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你自己刚才漏接害的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀…我们走囉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.97,0:04:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻松松回家囉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了小心有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好深
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会游泳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.97,0:05:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里在哪里哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啦这样好痒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们明天见囉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也不想小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里约会耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上发条的老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我不在大雄的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么事情都不会嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟你说不可以跟着我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈绝对不会答应的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.72,0:06:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦有狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄有老鼠…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有狗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有老鼠啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁妈妈这没有发现的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点带去房间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦 快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次发现的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约是三亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在人类和恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都这没有出现的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时就已经具有高度文明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是前所末有的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个发现已经引起了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界的高度关注
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考古现场目前这在持续
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行开挖的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考古学家深具信心地表示
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰箱里面有你们两个人的点心 这座遗迹的发现
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常谢谢你 将会改写人类的历史…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帮它取什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了我发现它的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有的时候会一一的叫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那叫阿一怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一这个名字很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在最大的问题是我们可以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,养它多久不被妈妈发现
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贴壁狗屋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前我们只能把它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,养在这个里面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贴在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一这里就是你的家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像它这么可爱的小狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有人把它丢掉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来…这个很便宜来看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:09:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要买什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要买什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹筴鱼怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹筴鱼那就买这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算便宜一点嘛老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家里的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食量都很大超会吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧既然这样多送你一条
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些猫搞什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶真是的拿你们没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安了阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢过去囉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来它叫阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一过来打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后会变成我的太太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来阿一这是静香
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为人家说宠物会像主人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你今天怎么会想到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要写功课
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个真好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不用写功课
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是那个玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是剑玉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面写的不是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是犬雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶买给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.25,0:12:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这广大的世界所有动物中…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其他的动物比你更慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你的动作会这么慢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳子断了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你…谢谢你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一会被妈妈发现的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没看过这只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是觉得那只猫很可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是被谁丢掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子好像吃了很多的苦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我想你的肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该很饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.55,0:14:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就是好朋友囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字呢因为被淋得湿答答的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以叫阿答
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是它们吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会不够
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想个办法才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过水管的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现里面有猫叫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们丢在那里太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险妈妈在睡午觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经这个时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦跑到哪里去了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于被我买到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说出来会嚇死你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免费食物制造机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.99,0:14:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用水跟空气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,培养出高蛋白绿藻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再配合猫狗的喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制造出它们的饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给它们吃的东西就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这台很贵的所以要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得最近怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么冰箱里面的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常常会不见大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.39,0:15:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现的话就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来去一个很远的深山里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是狗的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候开始养的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪怎么没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近新闻说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人把狗和猫丢到山里面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好过分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是为什么会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部聚集在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看八成是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.90,0:16:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要被开发成别墅区这是什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.94,0:16:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这些狗跟猫怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小灯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便一个地方都比这里好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这没有找到更好的地方之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能先忍耐一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都要乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.88,0:16:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:58.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个在这个地方做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易出生在这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却没有住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便弃养的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太自私了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错这全都是人类不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要把它们送到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人类的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样应该就可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要到没有恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有欺负狗跟猫的动物存在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.14,0:17:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远古的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错就是在三亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些全部都是属于你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这里有它们吃的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的阿一过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这个就可以搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了阿一使用方法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗怎么可能听得懂你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化退化放射线枪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调整到进化的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来了 好神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这挺聪明的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听得懂我说的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那听好囉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去跟其他的猫狗玩好了 首先你要把
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个开关先打开 OK
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后要按这个红色的按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好那你试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害真是太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来囉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这广大的世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有动物中…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它真的学的好快
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好囉阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要成为大家的领导者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你们的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是国旗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是漩涡的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是用你的大字去改的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦这是野狗野猫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野的意思啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正你们都是一国的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:49.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走囉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一明天我一定会再来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要保重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:21:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄动作快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:05.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.85,0:21:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你不要随便把我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四次元口袋拿走嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在跟你道歉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位都准备好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有在听我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有… 拜托你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要骂我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也等到了那边之后再骂嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我这个人会这么的好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.89,0:22:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入超时空扭曲地带…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是什么情形
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.41,0:22:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了忘记按控制按钮了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像跟昨天不同的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去调查看看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.44,0:22:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光罗盘上显示
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:23:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是在三亿年之后的一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.45,0:23:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.31,0:23:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天那个地点的一千年后囉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是城市已经有城市了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过一千年就这么进步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我们住的世界简直一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.43,0:23:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个真的好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.87,0:23:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对电影真挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.91,0:23:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗和猫全部都穿着衣服在走路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且它们全都会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才一千年的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.72,0:23:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就进化到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了搞不好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是进化退化放射线枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉在这里的关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么阿一他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是用了进化枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不断的在进化
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道阿一怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经过了一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能会这在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.90,0:24:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨天答应过阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会再回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点把时光机修好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再回到一千年前啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是零件刚刚在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.71,0:24:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超时空扭曲地带里被吹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.95,0:24:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们现在到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.25,0:24:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的科技已经这么的发达了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.76,0:24:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城市里面一定会有零件的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是修好就可以回家囉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啦所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.33,0:24:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小狗小猫的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.20,0:24:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要戴上这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.64,0:24:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以成为这里的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样长尾巴了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.17,0:24:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.11,0:24:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样我是小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于我呢当然是戴猫耳朵了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是狸猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.25,0:24:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在说什么真没礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:24:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.19,0:24:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦那我们现在就出发
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这个国家去探险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.77,0:25:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.96,0:25:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付掉毛的育毛剂毛加
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.69,0:25:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫毛加
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦游乐圆欢度25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时速三百公里的云霄飞车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许多充满梦幻的探险
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.31,0:25:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着大家的光临
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.82,0:25:54.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害完全是一个大都市嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妹妹怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:25:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈…不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:26:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗的警察
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是迷路的小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.79,0:26:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从刚刚刚始
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像大家都在笑我们耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.76,0:26:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要管这个我肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是用水和空气培养出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.51,0:26:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免费高蛋白绿藻食品
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.71,0:26:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.18,0:26:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是用免费食物制造机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.82,0:26:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.15,0:26:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常美味
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.82,0:26:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像被改造过了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.99,0:26:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了超时空扭曲地带是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.63,0:26:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在原有的时空中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.16,0:26:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又卡进了另一个时空
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.27,0:26:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才会到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千年以后的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.51,0:26:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停电了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:27:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 金色的节奏响起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮如同闪耀的太阳 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.43,0:27:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们一起在树林里聆听 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.63,0:27:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 用如同泡泡的云彩来洗脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 与清爽凉风一起散步… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.04,0:27:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的歌声好好听
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.05,0:27:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种程度的我也可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.68,0:27:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等…胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.62,0:27:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 望向蓝空 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.39,0:27:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 与彩虹结合 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.70,0:27:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 成为天空的彩带… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.17,0:27:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是受不了你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.37,0:27:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 希望明天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.91,0:28:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 这能幸福的过下去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.28,0:28:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是山猫轩的王牌歌星
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.95,0:28:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.26,0:28:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你叫我小哆哆这个送给你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你小哆哆
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次看见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.03,0:28:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你这样的猫族呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.00,0:28:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.57,0:28:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在在说我是猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.74,0:28:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七色铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.77,0:28:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有铜锣烧也给你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.48,0:28:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哆哆真会变魔术耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是因为我是二十二世纪的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.91,0:28:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫型机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.52,0:28:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.02,0:28:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要离开我夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.96,0:28:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.42,0:28:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.93,0:28:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.99,0:28:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.67,0:28:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.97,0:29:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.41,0:29:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢别人的东西这种行为不好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.84,0:29:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它这给我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.71,0:29:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.91,0:29:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我来对付你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.75,0:29:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫快去追他 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.19,0:29:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.69,0:29:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快追那边…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那边逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.10,0:29:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.84,0:29:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了把东西这给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.94,0:29:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.51,0:29:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.61,0:29:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念力眼药水
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中念力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.06,0:30:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.77,0:30:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往这边飞过来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.50,0:30:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.31,0:30:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.61,0:30:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我拿走囉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.78,0:30:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行阿…阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.61,0:30:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一站住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.72,0:30:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.86,0:30:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙这挺厉害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.90,0:30:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.18,0:30:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它跑得…这真快
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.79,0:31:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西…不是诺镭
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.86,0:31:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这给你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你是阿一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.49,0:31:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.66,0:31:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你是从
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.56,0:31:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个奇怪的地方来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从出生到现在都是叫做
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.64,0:31:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.90,0:31:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.67,0:31:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.51,0:31:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经过了一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.94,0:31:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一不可能这在的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.71,0:31:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了这个要送给
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要玩这个了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.78,0:31:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说的话你听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.82,0:31:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一般的铃铛 它们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.36,0:31:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.43,0:31:41.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的家人都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子她的爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.37,0:31:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我跟智子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.17,0:31:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去猫杰啦游乐圆玩以后
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都消矢不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.34,0:31:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只剩下我们而己
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.98,0:31:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也一样找不到它爸妈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:31:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子的爸爸妈妈是数学家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.12,0:32:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克的爸爸是电脑工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.02,0:32:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有布鲁太郎的爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.89,0:32:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是经营这个工厂的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.72,0:32:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面好像有什么关连
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.79,0:32:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你们报警了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.56,0:32:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们跟猫杰啦游乐圆的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.86,0:32:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关系很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.20,0:32:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算报警也不会相信我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.33,0:32:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.00,0:32:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为猫杰啦游乐圆的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个叫猫杰啦的有钱人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.81,0:32:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他准备参加下一任总统选举
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.84,0:32:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实力雄厚
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.78,0:32:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那以后你们就住在一起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.48,0:32:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样总比一个人好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.38,0:32:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们同心协力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.12,0:32:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信一定会有所发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.39,0:32:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且猫杰啦游乐圆里面
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有个很大的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.56,0:32:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定要把它找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.39,0:32:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们看一样好东西 达克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要这么多事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.73,0:32:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.44,0:32:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也一起出力
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.27,0:32:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮它们的忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.54,0:32:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有这种想法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.48,0:33:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫我们可是正义的使者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.42,0:33:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.86,0:33:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服也买不起的人都这样讲
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.56,0:33:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人感动
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.76,0:33:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服也买不起是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在穿的不是内衣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他这没穿衣服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.64,0:33:29.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更衣照相机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一想到刚刚我没有穿衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就出现在夏咪的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.02,0:33:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.32,0:33:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位真是不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.97,0:34:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么你说的是真的吗好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.11,0:34:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些猫族你一定要盯紧一点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.78,0:34:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗启示录里面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.35,0:34:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写了那个家伙的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如他真的是那只机器猫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.62,0:34:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要占领人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不是梦想了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.40,0:34:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.88,0:34:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:34:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.97,0:35:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行…不要推
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.73,0:35:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行过不去了别推
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.97,0:35:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这个就OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.91,0:35:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.04,0:35:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可以偷别人的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.58,0:35:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.98,0:35:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八东西这给人家
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.58,0:35:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听着
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.05,0:35:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动不动就对我说教
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.99,0:35:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.50,0:35:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄大家全部都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.11,0:35:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会跑去猫杰啦游乐圆了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去那里看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.63,0:36:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.96,0:36:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临猫杰啦游乐圆
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.37,0:36:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临请进…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.38,0:36:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.25,0:36:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来这里的目的不是要玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不要擅自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以免危险知道了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.79,0:36:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.33,0:36:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香我们去玩那个好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.46,0:36:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的我才刚刚讲完
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.50,0:36:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是好像很好玩等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.17,0:36:47.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夹到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.45,0:37:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.68,0:37:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.98,0:37:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们这不要下船
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦这里真的很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.65,0:37:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.69,0:37:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.86,0:37:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样诺镭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.36,0:37:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.30,0:37:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有这个就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.97,0:37:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要开始囉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真的没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.27,0:37:59.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是挖到运河的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用担心这一点啦小八
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.04,0:38:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我计算的绝对不可能会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.38,0:38:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小八他最怕水了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.68,0:38:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.69,0:38:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.25,0:38:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.83,0:38:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆祝猫杰啦游乐圆25周年纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而特别举办的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.70,0:38:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 金色的节奏响起… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.01,0:38:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.46,0:38:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.56,0:38:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.47,0:38:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来大家往那边逃快点
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.84,0:39:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光青苔大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.54,0:39:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.11,0:39:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.38,0:39:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.88,0:39:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.79,0:39:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这不是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.09,0:39:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是不是打算去找出
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.39,0:39:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦游乐圆的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.16,0:39:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为地底非常可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.99,0:39:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行这已经不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.30,0:39:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.20,0:39:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点出去外面嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了快点来挖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.37,0:39:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用手挖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是废话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.64,0:39:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.11,0:39:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄… 小八…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.99,0:39:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.56,0:39:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎达克智子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.13,0:39:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被关在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.53,0:39:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必担心哆啦A梦在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样保护我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.91,0:40:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.34,0:40:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 有什么能用…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.21,0:40:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么东西能用…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么东西能用…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.68,0:40:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你是为了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.75,0:40:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才来这里的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.22,0:40:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了遵守我的承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鼹鼠手套
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.46,0:40:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说那个阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.10,0:40:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我长得很像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.87,0:40:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.14,0:40:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个都没有受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.54,0:40:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然不需要使用诺镭…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.95,0:40:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是诺镭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么什么都不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.75,0:40:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是驱动所有机器的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.89,0:40:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东西
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.09,0:41:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就是所有能源的来源吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.86,0:41:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是现在我的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.36,0:41:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像已经快要用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.86,0:41:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.60,0:41:09.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看我的要开始囉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.40,0:41:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.81,0:41:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.88,0:41:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的地震是陨石造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.21,0:41:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我报告灾情
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.18,0:41:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实际的情况这没有确实的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.15,0:41:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过陨石坠落的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.72,0:41:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在东北的山坡地
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.69,0:41:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据推断
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石的直径大约是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.26,0:41:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二三十公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.90,0:41:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二三十公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.46,0:41:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是二三十公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.70,0:41:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.93,0:41:47.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位事己至此
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.17,0:41:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再向民众隐瞒实情
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.74,0:41:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上发表应对计划
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.01,0:41:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.08,0:41:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.02,0:42:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是猫杰啦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们剩下的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.09,0:42:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有三十六小时而己
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.09,0:42:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有我能帮上忙的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.19,0:42:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请尽量说不要客气
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.93,0:42:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.09,0:42:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直承受你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.13,0:42:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太感谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.67,0:42:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.60,0:42:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了我最爱的猫狗王国
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都顾意做
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.02,0:42:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.19,0:42:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时机终于成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.15,0:43:13.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定那些人就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.63,0:43:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.73,0:43:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸他…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.43,0:43:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.31,0:43:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八的妈妈是猫族的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.84,0:43:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在小八这小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.84,0:43:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被它们捡回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.85,0:43:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.98,0:43:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都被强迫来到这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.22,0:43:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后留在这里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.95,0:43:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.22,0:43:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.76,0:43:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.63,0:43:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子不可以单独擅自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.50,0:43:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.10,0:43:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是从哪里进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.70,0:43:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们不是什么可疑人物
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.60,0:44:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.04,0:44:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你们已经看到了觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.41,0:44:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.22,0:44:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦快点想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.16,0:44:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是第五区发现入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.22,0:44:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请求支援
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.96,0:44:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.03,0:44:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,智子 达克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.57,0:44:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八也在
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…别跑 站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.17,0:44:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么能用的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.61,0:44:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.48,0:44:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上掉落的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.85,0:44:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.75,0:44:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.42,0:44:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.69,0:44:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你现在
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.26,0:44:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有武器可以用了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.09,0:44:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.69,0:44:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是为了要保护家庭的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.63,0:45:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一同迎向光明的末来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.26,0:45:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能…对了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.53,0:45:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑夜灯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.10,0:45:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照顾人类的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.31,0:45:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.01,0:45:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.58,0:45:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好大家都跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.18,0:45:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.12,0:45:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.39,0:45:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.22,0:45:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.92,0:45:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.66,0:45:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.43,0:45:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你帮我拿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.66,0:45:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们乖乖的束手就擒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.14,0:45:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.61,0:45:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪站住
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.78,0:45:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.89,0:46:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.70,0:46:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经醒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.27,0:46:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪她怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.01,0:46:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果夏咪小姐出了什么事的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.21,0:46:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.71,0:46:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.48,0:46:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要乖乖照我的话去做
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.98,0:46:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会杀你的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.18,0:46:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是猫杰啦对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.19,0:46:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.52,0:46:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是猫杰啦游乐圆的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.49,0:46:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦左卫门之丞景虎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.33,0:46:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好长的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.93,0:46:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那地底下的那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.76,0:46:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底又是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.57,0:46:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是我们家族
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.73,0:46:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代代相传的黑暗启示录里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.20,0:46:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写的机器猫的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.77,0:46:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该就会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.07,0:46:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.44,0:46:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.91,0:46:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以在时间与空间里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.35,0:46:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由来回穿梭的时空方舟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.32,0:47:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有你不可思议的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.95,0:47:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拿出不可思议的道具的事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.82,0:47:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也写在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.62,0:47:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那本书到底是谁写的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.09,0:47:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.69,0:47:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是在一千年以前
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.96,0:47:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们伟大猫杰啦家族的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.16,0:47:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿答先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.00,0:47:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿答…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.54,0:47:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.34,0:47:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被淋得湿答答的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.97,0:47:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以叫阿答
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.15,0:47:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.95,0:47:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你做那么大台的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.02,0:47:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.15,0:47:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了总统在电视上
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.32,0:47:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发表事情的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听他讲完之后我再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.66,0:47:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲爱的猫狗王国的民众
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.57,0:47:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一件哀伤的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.43,0:47:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.44,0:47:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在三十六小时后
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.94,0:47:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们所居住的这个美丽的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.61,0:48:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将遭受到陨石群的袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.74,0:48:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.91,0:48:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的陨石直径是二十公里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.71,0:48:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的动植物全都会灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.29,0:48:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这将是一次毁灭性的破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.25,0:48:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.29,0:48:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在二十一世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.36,0:48:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所发现的遗迹之迷
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.89,0:48:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来就是这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.73,0:48:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过各位也不需要绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.87,0:48:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们早就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.57,0:48:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会发生这件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.30,0:48:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以已经提早做了准备
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.27,0:48:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是逃离地球计划
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.58,0:48:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据这个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.88,0:48:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而建造逃离地球的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.98,0:48:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数量己足够让全体国民搭乘
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.42,0:48:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且能源的来源诺镭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.65,0:48:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也已经全部都搬到船上了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.69,0:48:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要移居的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.29,0:48:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是位在大犬座的一个行星
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.36,0:48:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且那里的环境
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.56,0:48:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我们地球是一模一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.40,0:48:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这颗美丽的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.17,0:49:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然让人觉得悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.60,0:49:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.61,0:49:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要全体国民共同努力
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.47,0:49:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们带着勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.54,0:49:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起往新世界出发
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.58,0:49:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果再继续这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.11,0:49:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.98,0:49:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦跟小八
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底跑到哪里去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.19,0:49:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.62,0:49:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细听好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.79,0:49:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空方舟已经完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.63,0:49:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们的利用价值也没了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.40,0:49:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就乖乖跟着地球
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.70,0:49:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起接受命运的到来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.27,0:49:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.01,0:49:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们这一族的新旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.94,0:49:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是去宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.68,0:49:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要坐时光机到末来去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.51,0:49:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,末…末来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.45,0:49:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.68,0:49:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去征服末来的人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.12,0:49:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让所有的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.49,0:49:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都成为我们的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.02,0:49:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宠…宠物为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:49:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗启示录里面
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.03,0:50:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记载了我们的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.83,0:50:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是猫或是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.60,0:50:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都受到了人类的摧残
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.77,0:50:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类利用宠物这个字眼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剥夺我们的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.14,0:50:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腻了就随手丢弃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类就是恶魔之子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.75,0:50:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样的人类已经没有资格
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.02,0:50:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生存在这个地球之上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.79,0:50:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你也是猫族的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.79,0:50:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就过来帮我的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.29,0:50:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会帮你做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.10,0:50:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.40,0:50:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让你看看这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.67,0:50:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏…夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.41,0:50:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你不答应的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.02,0:50:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪会有什么下场呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.35,0:51:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.49,0:51:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.93,0:51:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发时间是今天下午六点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.54,0:51:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以请大家要保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.07,0:51:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发时间是今天下午六点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.94,0:51:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.98,0:51:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就是我们的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.44,0:51:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骗了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.45,0:51:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.35,0:51:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你们自己逃走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.42,0:51:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且这是到末来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.59,0:51:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要对人类怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.26,0:51:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样机器猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.17,0:51:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你到底要我帮你做什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.37,0:51:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看了就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.94,0:51:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.01,0:52:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是进化退化放射线枪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.45,0:52:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.55,0:52:05.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我把它修好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.42,0:52:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要用这个把残暴的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.73,0:52:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退化到他们最原始的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.69,0:52:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就可以轻而易举的征服了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.27,0:52:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.17,0:52:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要帮我把这个修好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.40,0:52:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪就可以得救不然的话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.77,0:52:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时速三百公里的云霄飞车
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.51,0:52:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会从夏咪身上辗过去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.12,0:52:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你真的是太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.79,0:52:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.20,0:52:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.50,0:52:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点住手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.70,0:52:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底要不要修
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.97,0:52:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化退化放射线枪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.10,0:52:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我修…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.39,0:53:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我有这个东西的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.99,0:53:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个家伙已经没有用处了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.36,0:53:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫五
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.13,0:53:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.53,0:53:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以把他拆除了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.34,0:53:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你没事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.11,0:53:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.44,0:53:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只机器猫应该这有用处
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.48,0:53:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是他不听话的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.42,0:53:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候再把他拆了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.92,0:53:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么难…难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.85,0:53:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.42,0:53:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都没错哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.33,0:53:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把机器猫关到时光机里面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.60,0:53:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.43,0:53:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.73,0:53:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到你居然是猫杰啦的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.23,0:54:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.70,0:54:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.98,0:54:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他带走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.98,0:54:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.22,0:54:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在一切都已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.06,0:54:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫五执行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.39,0:54:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.56,0:54:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.90,0:54:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是把政府拥有的诺镭抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.27,0:54:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是您要是这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.80,0:54:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没有办法离开地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.47,0:54:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁管它们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.04,0:54:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要让时空方舟启动的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.61,0:54:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是需要非常庞大的能源才行
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.81,0:54:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.38,0:54:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你也是猫杰啦一族的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.69,0:54:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能让你背判我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.54,0:55:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这里是能源署
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.41,0:55:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人侵入了诺镭的储藏仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.81,0:55:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请求支援
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.59,0:55:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂发生什么事了喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.99,0:55:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么诺镭被抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.33,0:55:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.73,0:55:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源署被不名人士入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.30,0:55:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃离地球用的诺镭
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.70,0:55:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.00,0:55:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.64,0:55:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上派人去搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.17,0:55:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何一定要拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.93,0:56:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.66,0:56:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来现在的地球已经不行了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.10,0:56:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道那边的世界是什么样子 我们一定要想办法逃出去才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.24,0:56:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.21,0:56:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.92,0:56:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引起守卫的注意才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.85,0:56:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话绝对错不了的 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.39,0:56:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个好东西 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.56,0:56:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.26,0:56:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.90,0:56:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是从哪里跑来的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.23,0:56:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.44,0:56:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.24,0:56:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按那个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.28,0:56:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.75,0:56:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.21,0:56:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.45,0:57:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先到外面去再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.62,0:57:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦在那个东西里面
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.60,0:57:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.43,0:57:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人全部都逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.64,0:57:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在要去把他们抓回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.17,0:57:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无所畏不用管他们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.37,0:57:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正他们也没救了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.61,0:57:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只要等我们准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.11,0:57:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就出发
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.52,0:57:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到外面了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.26,0:57:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了我们要赶快向总统
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.03,0:57:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告这件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.33,0:57:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.90,0:57:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.80,0:57:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去把哆啦A梦救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.94,0:57:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下哆啦A梦不管
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:57:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是当然的囉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.18,0:58:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了我们也会留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.71,0:58:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然要留下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.31,0:58:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.92,0:58:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.05,0:58:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈你跟大家一起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.25,0:58:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去向总统报告这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.15,0:58:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.25,0:58:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.09,0:58:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.09,0:58:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好动作快点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.16,0:58:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.33,0:58:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.17,0:58:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了什么事…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.34,0:58:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.92,0:58:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是时空方舟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.35,0:58:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.79,0:58:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想有没有什么好办法
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了用云霄飞车载那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.63,0:58:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.73,0:58:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对一口气往下冲的话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.00,0:58:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用它的冲力
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.83,0:59:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以从那里飞出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.74,0:59:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好就这么决定大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.91,0:59:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到诺镭的能源充满以后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.95,0:59:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就进入时空隧道里面
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.29,0:59:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就看你的了大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动开关
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.80,0:59:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.27,0:59:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.77,0:59:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.97,0:59:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.48,0:59:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.19,0:59:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是陨石
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.50,1:00:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是陨石掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.11,1:00:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要开始冲了大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.61,1:00:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.55,1:00:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.98,1:00:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.96,1:00:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.80,1:00:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲… 成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.10,1:00:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.02,1:00:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是在时光机里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.46,1:01:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把机器的引擎关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.00,1:01:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.27,1:01:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你们得逞的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.00,1:01:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶舱到底在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.51,1:01:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.41,1:01:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等一下有了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.75,1:01:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名刀电光丸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.51,1:01:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去囉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.35,1:01:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.35,1:01:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的功夫怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.36,1:01:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.52,1:01:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是电光丸它自己会动的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.99,1:01:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.56,1:01:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不用担心
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.63,1:01:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是晕过去而己
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.20,1:01:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.33,1:01:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的这有其他人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.74,1:01:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三四
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.71,1:01:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人讨厌的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.28,1:02:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下一点点而己
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.52,1:02:09.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了你们这些人类觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.80,1:02:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.97,1:02:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.20,1:02:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.70,1:02:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.74,1:02:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.78,1:02:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.18,1:02:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这想来破坏我的计划吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.51,1:02:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个去找引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.35,1:02:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.82,1:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心一点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.73,1:02:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体国民请马上开始避难
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.47,1:02:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.40,1:02:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.91,1:03:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电池没电了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.68,1:03:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜负已经分出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.35,1:03:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.99,1:03:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那个好像就是引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.04,1:03:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了小八
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.64,1:03:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好我先偷偷过去那里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.25,1:03:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这里想干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.66,1:03:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.00,1:03:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.84,1:04:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.10,1:04:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.01,1:04:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪把发射的开关打开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.04,1:04:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.85,1:04:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪千万不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.48,1:04:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.15,1:04:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要管他快点去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.42,1:04:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.22,1:04:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点打开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.93,1:04:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.13,1:04:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.96,1:04:31.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.07,1:04:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可以这么过分
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.34,1:04:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.77,1:04:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.27,1:04:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐猫杰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.91,1:04:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我是真的…生气了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认输了吗猫杰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.46,1:05:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认输了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.27,1:05:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪为了我你要振作一点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.11,1:05:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.68,1:05:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.49,1:05:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.89,1:05:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真厉害你怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个…其实我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.11,1:05:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.66,1:06:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.68,1:06:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.43,1:06:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.80,1:06:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.20,1:06:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.21,1:06:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.34,1:06:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.75,1:07:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.52,1:07:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.59,1:07:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错约好的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.59,1:07:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都在等你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.74,1:07:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统万岁…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你好久了大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.29,1:07:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就能见到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.13,1:07:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.95,1:08:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.82,1:08:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错我就是我就是阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.60,1:08:32.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.34,1:08:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.34,1:08:34.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.94,1:08:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八…看来是没救了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.01,1:08:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个都不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.88,1:08:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说八道什么大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.95,1:08:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.49,1:08:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.63,1:08:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.53,1:08:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们…这活着耶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.57,1:09:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.00,1:09:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.67,1:09:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.31,1:09:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.55,1:09:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊 是谁谁在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.32,1:09:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这广大的世界 是奶奶吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.82,1:09:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有动物中
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.35,1:09:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其他的动物比你更慢了 不对那个声音…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.59,1:09:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你的动作会这么慢呢 确实是…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.30,1:09:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.10,1:09:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.43,1:09:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.14,1:09:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.37,1:09:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.15,1:09:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.85,1:09:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.48,1:09:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.08,1:09:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.02,1:09:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.59,1:09:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.69,1:09:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你果然是阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.59,1:09:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.96,1:10:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个…你保存起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.37,1:10:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.38,1:10:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.51,1:10:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过可以实现我的诺言
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.81,1:10:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.95,1:10:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来大雄说的都是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.19,1:10:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他是怎么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.02,1:10:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这一千年后来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.02,1:10:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是思念的心情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.09,1:10:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让奇迹发生了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.39,1:10:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想哭喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.30,1:10:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.50,1:10:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.40,1:10:42.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八诺镭都在水底
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.47,1:10:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.04,1:10:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺镭只要一碰到水
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.08,1:10:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会变成没用的东西了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.21,1:10:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.91,1:10:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃难用的太空船就不能飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.88,1:10:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.42,1:10:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.45,1:10:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么好方法
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.99,1:11:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.52,1:11:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.06,1:11:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是神
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.09,1:11:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是神耶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们说大雄是神
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.93,1:11:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.77,1:11:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都不用担心
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.00,1:11:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎你们先去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.63,1:11:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像我们家附近的空地耶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位这就是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.70,1:11:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初创造我们这个世界的神
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.00,1:11:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.84,1:11:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…真的是大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.62,1:12:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一那诺镭到底在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.79,1:12:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里这座大雄的雕像
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.33,1:12:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都是用诺镭做出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.30,1:12:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.64,1:12:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到尾都是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.70,1:12:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好惊人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.77,1:12:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没时间了动作快
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.52,1:12:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是好危险
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.09,1:12:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没到机场吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.82,1:12:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要冲囉抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.44,1:12:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的人类我一定要报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.21,1:13:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是猫杰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.18,1:13:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打死你…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.72,1:13:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.60,1:13:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.27,1:13:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.71,1:13:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心我会担住的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.44,1:13:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就会让你放轻松
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.02,1:13:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是隧道真是好险
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.25,1:13:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.20,1:13:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的人类
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.00,1:14:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.04,1:14:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.51,1:14:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两只手都抓着绳子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.04,1:14:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有办法拿道具啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.48,1:14:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄不要管我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.85,1:14:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.22,1:14:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.69,1:14:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.46,1:14:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦我来帮你拿道具
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.43,1:14:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.10,1:14:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.27,1:14:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.41,1:14:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.72,1:14:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.82,1:14:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个真好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.63,1:14:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.59,1:15:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.27,1:15:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.84,1:15:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个剑玉拿给我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.90,1:15:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.34,1:15:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来控制方向盘
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.68,1:15:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.11,1:15:20.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钓到鱼了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.25,1:15:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.15,1:15:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把剑玉瞄准猫杰啦丢过去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.58,1:15:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.95,1:15:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样使出全力
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.20,1:15:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.00,1:15:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.30,1:15:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.40,1:15:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.24,1:15:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.74,1:15:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放大灯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.87,1:16:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.11,1:16:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的人都已经上船了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.84,1:16:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时可以出发
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.28,1:17:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光机现在也已经完全修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.92,1:17:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们帮了这么多的忙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.52,1:17:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表全体国民向你们道谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.96,1:17:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.29,1:17:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这次我们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.16,1:17:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要分开了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.80,1:17:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一你跟我们一起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.83,1:17:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到二十一世纪去好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不可以这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.47,1:17:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有责任要在新的星球上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.07,1:17:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和所有的人一起创造
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.67,1:17:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个新的国家才行
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.28,1:17:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事交给别人去做
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.88,1:17:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.75,1:17:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄这是不可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.92,1:17:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一已经进化到跟人类一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.52,1:17:40.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能把他带到
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.55,1:17:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十一世纪去啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.52,1:17:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦说的一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.79,1:17:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们也不能去改变
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.79,1:17:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.96,1:17:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.70,1:17:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.84,1:18:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.51,1:18:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.91,1:18:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.11,1:18:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.01,1:18:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.95,1:18:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子绝对不会忘记你的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.15,1:18:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.75,1:18:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要保重智子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.66,1:18:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达克不要感冒囉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.09,1:18:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.19,1:18:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再穿内衣出门
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.43,1:18:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁太郎 胖虎…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.60,1:18:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.61,1:18:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.81,1:18:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.48,1:18:36.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.34,1:18:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见再见了大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.08,1:18:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.15,1:18:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.25,1:18:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.92,1:18:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.66,1:18:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都要拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.55,1:19:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.86,1:19:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的乌龟先生
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.16,1:19:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌龟先生啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.43,1:19:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这广大的世界所有动物中
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有其他的动物比你更慢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.87,1:19:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你的动作会这么慢呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.91,1:20:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们居住的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.18,1:20:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这四十六亿年间
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.88,1:20:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不断的重复着这件事情
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.22,1:20:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从出生到消矢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.22,1:20:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后又有新的生命再出现
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.69,1:20:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也就跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.53,1:20:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爷爷有奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.73,1:20:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爸爸有妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.00,1:20:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就会换我们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.23,1:20:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢变成爸爸和妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.23,1:20:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再成为爷爷和奶奶了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.14,1:20:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在末来宇宙的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.54,1:20:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定我们的子孙
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.14,1:20:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿一的子孙会再相见
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.48,1:20:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.68,1:20:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧阿一
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.44,1:21:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 仿如黄金铜钹的鸣奏 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.30,1:21:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 喃喃细语的是太阳公公 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.66,1:21:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一起光临 木荫的宴会 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.84,1:21:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 侧耳倾听吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.64,1:21:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 用肥皂的云把脸洗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.20,1:21:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 与微风散步 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.41,1:21:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一定没问题的 组成翅膀的心扉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.80,1:21:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让它绽放光芒吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.50,1:22:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 用彩虹编织而成的晴空丝带 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.85,1:22:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 是作为你的笑容的礼物 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.04,1:22:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在梦晴天下许愿吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.59,1:22:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 愿明天能如常美好 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.50,1:22:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在白云棉花糖的边际 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.46,1:22:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 是稍作休息的草原 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.70,1:22:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 微风的归处何在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.92,1:22:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我向鸟儿寻问道 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.76,1:22:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 披上夕阳的花边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.31,1:23:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 和逐渐延伸的影子追逐嘻戏 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.54,1:23:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我会永远守护你的光亮新月 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.80,1:23:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 被她的温柔 所拥抱 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.23,1:23:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 用彩虹编织而成的晴空丝带 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.51,1:23:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 是作为你的笑容的礼物 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.74,1:23:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在梦晴天下许愿吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.26,1:23:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 愿明天能如常美好 ∮
